  message: "Investigated 2026-06-01 for cluster context. Parent set to INV-numat (P1 pending_validation, META: vocabulary fields mix multiple semantic axes). WI-kadop is the third application of the field-split pattern previously applied in this campaign: ADR-0031 split Symbol.language → discovery_language + protocol_origin; ADR-0032 split Symbol.canonical_name → display_label + qualified_name; WI-kadop splits Symbol.origin → origin (pass-id only) + new synthesis_mechanism field. ~492 Symbols in dogfood-corpus 20260528 carry synthesis-mechanism strings ('inheritance', 'orchestrator_file_symbol_synthesis', 'scip') in the origin field. Phase 6 PR5 added _SYNTHESIS_MECHANISMS frozenset as catalog stopgap; this WI is the architectural fix. Doesn't duplicate any preexisting row — it's a new face of INV-numat."  # f554
